* Complementary MOS-referenced voltages with no ideal bias anywhere
* Each branch pins its own node through a diode-connected device fed by a
* resistor from the rail. At the low end of a supply ramp both branches sit
* in subthreshold, so the output is dominated by exactly the surface a
* linear-axis Id-Vgs metric cannot see.
<MODEL_SETUP>
Vdd vdd 0 <VDD>
Vbn bn 0 <BODY_N>
Vbp bp 0 <BODY_P>
Rn vdd nr <REF_RBIAS>
<N_PREFIX>n_ref nr nr 0 bn <N_DEVICE>
Rp np 0 <REF_RBIAS>
<P_PREFIX>p_ref np np vdd bp <P_DEVICE>
<OUTPUT_LOAD>
.temp <TEMP>
<ANALYSIS>
.end
